<%# Owner-only analytics dashboard (Slice 5, Part B). Aggregates only, off the
    denormalized hujahs counters — no per-voter data anywhere.

    DESIGN SYSTEM (Slice 9, Task 4.7) — docs/design-system/components/analytics/*.prompt.md
    for the two chips and the bars; readme.md VISUAL FOUNDATIONS for everything else.

    The page title takes the product's page-title idiom, `text-lg font-medium mb-3`, the
    same string `blocks/index`, `users/followers` and `users/following` already use —
    that shared string is the whole reason, and it is enough. It was `text-xl font-bold`;
    VISUAL FOUNDATIONS puts weights at "medium for names/CTAs, semibold section heads,
    bold rare" — a page title is neither of the rare cases. (No argument is made from the
    20px size itself: readme.md hands 20px to the single-hujah body, but it hands 18px to
    a hujah body too, so "that size is a body size" would rule out the size we picked just
    as fast as the one we dropped.) `text-black` came off with it
    because `@layer base` already paints the body `--fg-body`, which IS `--color-black`.

    The `gap-3` on the chip row is StatChip.prompt.md's "12px gap", stated once here
    because `ui/_card` (and therefore `_stat`) owns no margin of its own.

    The empty state is `ui/_empty_state` rather than the icon + sentence this file used to
    hand-roll — the sixth and last of the six copies that partial was extracted from. Its
    baked-in `p-3 bg-white` and `gap-1` reproduce what was here; what it drops is
    `rounded`. The authority for that is its OWN component file, not Card.prompt.md:
    docs/design-system/components/core/EmptyState.jsx declares a background, padding, a
    gap, a font size and a colour — and no `borderRadius` at all. An empty state is not a
    card, so "Never round a feed card" was never the rule that applied to it; the rule
    that applies is that this component has no corner radius to begin with. The sentence
    is unchanged to the byte, and EmptyState.prompt.md quotes it as real product copy. %>
<%= render "shared/navbar" %>

<main class="max-w-xl mx-auto px-4 py-6">
  <h1 class="text-lg font-medium mb-3">Your dashboard</h1>

  <div class="flex gap-3 mb-6">
    <%= render "stat", label: "Votes received", value: @analytics.total_votes_received %>
    <%= render "stat", label: "Arguments received", value: @analytics.total_arguments_received %>
  </div>

  <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-grey mb-3">Your hoojahs</h2>
  <% if @analytics.distributions.any? %>
    <%= render partial: "distribution_bar", collection: @analytics.distributions, as: :dist %>
  <% else %>
    <%= render "ui/empty_state", message: "You haven't posted any hoojahs yet", icon: "bar-chart-3" %>
  <% end %>
</main>
